{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\074.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Look at this square. It is divided into 100 equal parts.", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[164, 136], [975, 117], [976, 157], [165, 175]]}, {"text": "25 out of 100 parts are coloured.", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[165, 187], [668, 178], [669, 218], [166, 227]]}, {"text": "or 0.25 of the square is coloured.", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[246, 237], [756, 228], [757, 267], [247, 276]]}, {"text": "100", "conf": 0.749, "box": [[165, 264], [223, 264], [223, 299], [165, 299]]}, {"text": "So, 25% of the whole square is coloured.", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[163, 327], [786, 314], [787, 354], [164, 367]]}, {"text": "Write:25%", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[164, 394], [340, 392], [340, 426], [165, 428]]}, {"text": "Read:Twenty-five percent", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[165, 456], [567, 450], [568, 485], [166, 491]]}, {"text": "What percentage of the", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[578, 530], [968, 520], [969, 559], [579, 569]]}, {"text": "square is not coloured?", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[580, 585], [949, 572], [951, 608], [581, 620]]}, {"text": "Now, have a look at this square. 8 out of 100 parts are pink.", "conf": 0.94, "box": [[166, 685], [1100, 667], [1101, 709], [167, 728]]}, {"text": "So, 8% of the whole square is pink.", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[164, 758], [699, 750], [700, 790], [165, 797]]}, {"text": "Write: 8%", "conf": 0.76, "box": [[164, 828], [322, 826], [323, 863], [165, 865]]}, {"text": "Read: Eight percent", "conf": 0.819, "box": [[166, 888], [473, 888], [473, 925], [166, 925]]}, {"text": "What percentage of the whole square is yellow?", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[163, 962], [916, 958], [916, 998], [163, 1001]]}, {"text": "What percentage of the whole square is blue?", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[165, 1013], [886, 1013], [886, 1052], [165, 1052]]}, {"text": "4.1.1Express onequantityas apercentageofanother", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[159, 1087], [1231, 1090], [1231, 1139], [159, 1136]]}, {"text": "Example 1: Saman used 8 eggs out of 40 eggs to make a few cupcakes. Express used", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[166, 1152], [1621, 1157], [1621, 1198], [166, 1193]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.884, "box": [[165, 1256], [318, 1259], [317, 1292], [164, 1289]]}, {"text": "First write it in the form of a fraction.", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[171, 1306], [742, 1314], [741, 1347], [170, 1339]]}, {"text": "8 out of 40 =", "conf": 0.859, "box": [[168, 1385], [378, 1390], [377, 1424], [167, 1419]]}, {"text": "40", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[410, 1405], [457, 1405], [457, 1443], [410, 1443]]}, {"text": "Now multiply the fraction by 100 and put the % symbol.", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[167, 1457], [1052, 1471], [1051, 1510], [166, 1496]]}, {"text": "× 100%", "conf": 0.71, "box": [[350, 1540], [469, 1540], [469, 1574], [350, 1574]]}, {"text": "40", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[174, 1553], [223, 1553], [223, 1588], [174, 1588]]}, {"text": "40", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[289, 1555], [337, 1555], [337, 1592], [289, 1592]]}, {"text": "Simplify if possible.", "conf": 0.94, "box": [[167, 1605], [467, 1611], [467, 1653], [166, 1648]]}, {"text": "Whenexpressing onequantityas a", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[1057, 1643], [1559, 1661], [1558, 1693], [1056, 1676]]}, {"text": "20", "conf": 0.622, "box": [[387, 1654], [421, 1654], [421, 1685], [387, 1685]]}, {"text": "× 100%", "conf": 0.759, "box": [[351, 1678], [474, 1681], [473, 1719], [349, 1716]]}, {"text": "percentage of another,both", "conf": 0.889, "box": [[1058, 1690], [1463, 1700], [1462, 1733], [1057, 1723]]}, {"text": "quantities must be in the same units.", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[1057, 1733], [1585, 1749], [1584, 1785], [1056, 1768]]}, {"text": "20", "conf": 0.546, "box": [[292, 1746], [339, 1746], [339, 1782], [292, 1782]]}, {"text": "So, she used 20% of the total eggs.", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[170, 1783], [716, 1795], [715, 1834], [169, 1822]]}, {"text": "CHING", "conf": 0.793, "box": [[204, 1843], [262, 1838], [264, 1864], [206, 1869]]}, {"text": "and share their findings with their class-fellows.", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[309, 1923], [941, 1934], [941, 1967], [309, 1956]]}, {"text": "72", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[847, 2030], [899, 2030], [899, 2069], [847, 2069]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.835, "box": [[1220, 2047], [1533, 2063], [1531, 2096], [1218, 2080]]}]}